From fa7406b5b9db17afe08b0ab675ee45f3121b365e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: adam <adam@pkgsrc.org>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 12:05:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] libarchive: updated to 3.8.10

3.8.10

New features:

7z: add Delta, RISCV, ARMTHUMB and IA64 filters for non-lzma archives
libarchive: support digest with nettle 4 and mbedtls 3
tar: add --mode option

Security and Bug Fixes

see ChangeLog
